2026-09-24T02:48:07.0892955Z   dw view technical                  Open the complete engineering command surface
2026-09-24T02:48:07.0893436Z 
2026-09-24T02:48:07.0893669Z A blocked or observed runtime action is not proof that the final software works.
2026-09-24T02:48:07.0894325Z DiffWitness verifies the resulting Git change independently. Source code and raw prompts/diffs stay local by default.
2026-09-24T02:48:07.0894763Z 
2026-09-24T02:48:07.0894991Z For every command and advanced workflow: `dw view technical`, then `dw --help`.
2026-09-24T02:48:07.0895310Z 
2026-09-24T02:48:07.0895769Z Language: English by default. Save with `dw language en|fr`; override once with `dw --language en|fr <command>`. OS locale never selects product language.
